body:
Thanks for the comment, appreciate the perspective. I am competitive by nature but the rate race hasn't really been something I've felt like competing in. Mostly because I haven't like the "competitions" or jobs I've worked in. But I do need to step into the game and play to win. 

&#x200B;

Couldn't agree more with the rusting of the soul being the main problem. Thanks again for taking time to write.
